{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"content":"She would stand there with her hands on her hips, peering through her reading glasses at the ruined rows, shaking her head not in anger, but in a resigned sort of humor. It was a yearly ritual as consistent as the blooming of the hydrangeas, a persistent negotiation between her patience and the appetites of the local wildlife. I remember crouching beside her, trying to count the gaps in the dirt, convinced that next year she would finally install those electric fences she’d been talking about for a decade. But she never did. She just smiled, patted the soil, and promised me we’d try tomatoes in the fall. We never did. We went back to the beans, because some things, like the rabbits showing up, just happen.","role":"assistant"}}],"created":1792460795,"id":"chatcmpl-18e01998c3df20a70068","model":"qwen3.8-27b-fp8","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"aien_sampling":{"greedy_tokens":0,"kept":[248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,2